WEBVTT

00:07.520 --> 00:09.300
It seems Zhen has lost.

00:09.760 --> 00:11.200
Your son merely got lucky.

00:12.280 --> 00:17.000
Wen Xian, you've watched for quite a while. Give us your verdict.

00:17.360 --> 00:22.100
His Highness the Prince of Jin is exceptionally quick-witted—in Weiqi, he likely has no rival within the entire palace!

00:22.400 --> 00:29.300
Quite unlike the Prince of Ning, a hopeless novice who rushes to the palace to wager whenever he gets his hands on rare treasures!
